  m_Name: Carta_CampanhaDeVacinacao
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Campanha de Vacina\xE7\xE3o"
  _titleEn: Vaccination Campaign
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Vacinar em massa protege quem toma a vacina e tamb\xE9m quem n\xE3o
    pode tomar, porque o v\xEDrus passa a circular menos."
  _summaryEn: Mass vaccination protects those who get the vaccine and also those
    who cannot, because the virus circulates less.
  _realWorld: "O Programa Nacional de Imuniza\xE7\xF5es, criado em 1973, levou o
    Brasil a eliminar a poliomielite e oferece dezenas de vacinas de gra\xE7a pelo
    SUS."
  _realWorldEn: Brazil's National Immunization Program, created in 1973, led the
    country to eliminate polio and offers dozens of vaccines for free through the
    public health system.
  _tradeOffs: "Campanhas exigem cadeia de frio, equipes e comunica\xE7\xE3o cont\xEDnua;
    a desinforma\xE7\xE3o faz a cobertura cair."
  _tradeOffsEn: Campaigns require cold chains, staff and constant communication;
    misinformation makes coverage drop.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Programa Nacional de Imuniza\xE7\xF5es (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Programa_Nacional_de_Imuniza%C3%A7%C3%B5es
  - Label: "Vacina\xE7\xE3o (Minist\xE9rio da Sa\xFAde)"
    Url: https://www.gov.br/saude/pt-br/vacinacao
